scotch
------------------------------------------
Scotch is a software package for graph and mesh/hypergraph partitioning, graph
clustering, static mapping and sparse matrix ordering. PT-Scotch is its
parallel, MPI-based version, and libptscotchparmetis provides a
ParMETIS-compatible interface on top of it.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbz2-devel-1.0.8-2
  libbz2_1-1.0.8-2
  libevent-devel-2.1.13-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libhwloc-devel-2.13.0-1
  liblzma-devel-5.8.4-1
  liblzma5-5.8.4-1
  libopenmpi-devel-4.1.6-1
  libopenmpi40-4.1.6-1
  libptscotch7.0-7.0.18-1bl1
  libscotch7.0-7.0.18-1bl1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  bison-3.8.2-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.13-1
  flex-2.6.4-2
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libbz2-devel-1.0.8-2
  libevent-devel-2.1.13-1
  libhwloc-devel-2.13.0-1
  liblzma-devel-5.8.4-1
  libopenmpi-devel-4.1.6-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://gitlab.inria.fr/scotch/scotch

Canonical download:
  https://gitlab.inria.fr/scotch/scotch/-/archive/v7.0.18/scotch-v7.0.18.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack scotch-7.0.18-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./scotch-7.0.18-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/scotch-7.0.18-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/scotch-7.0.18-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/ptscotch-7.0.18-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libscotch7.0-7.0.18-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libptscotch7.0-7.0.18-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libscotch-devel-7.0.18-X.tar.xz

